# 多条目 Inventory 时的 dataTag 匹配。
#
# 1.12.2 的匹配器 `GameProfileSerializer.a(NBTBase, NBTBase, boolean)` 对
# **列表**的规则是：**过滤器的每个元素都要在主体里找到某个匹配**，两个列表
# **不要求等长**。
#
# 所以「过滤器只写一件物品、物品栏里有好几件」是**能匹配上的**——真服实测
# 就是这样（见探针用例 48-datatag-inventory）。
#
# 和探针用例 48-datatag-inventory 一一对应。
name: data tag and inventory

setup:
  gomcplayer Steve 0 4 0

run:
  scoreboard objectives add kills dummy
  give Steve minecraft:stone 1
  give Steve minecraft:dirt 1
  scoreboard players set Steve kills 1 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b}]}
  scoreboard players set Steve kills 2 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:gold",Count:1b}]}
  scoreboard players set Steve kills 3 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b},{id:"minecraft:dirt",Count:1b}]}
  scoreboard players set Steve kills 4 {Inventory:[{id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b},{id:"minecraft:gold",Count:1b}]}
